        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\n&#39; BrewLite — UML Deployment Diagram, Task 3.2\n&#39; Nguồn: HEAD 42553db8; quan sát live 2026-11-13\n&#39; Giữ nguyên Node ID N1-N19 theo brief.\n\nleft to right direction\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 11\nskinparam node {\n  BackgroundColor White\n  BorderColor #374151\n  FontColor #111827\n}\nskinparam artifact {\n  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB\n  BorderColor #6B7280\n  FontColor #111827\n}\nskinparam database {\n  BackgroundColor #F3F4F6\n  BorderColor #374151\n  FontColor #111827\n}\nskinparam note {\n  BackgroundColor #FFFBE6\n  BorderColor #A3A3A3\n  FontColor #111827\n}\nskinparam package {\n  BackgroundColor White\n  BorderColor #6B7280\n  FontColor #111827\n}\n\ntitle BrewLite — UML Deployment Diagram (Task 3.2)\\nProduction thực tế + Local + CI/CD | HEAD 42553db8 | Live audit 13-11-2026\n\n&#39; CLIENT — nằm ngoài ba boundary\nnode \&quot;Thiết bị khách hàng / Admin\\nTrình duyệt Web\\n[VERIFIED — LIVE]\&quot; as N1 &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; BOUNDARY 1 — LOCAL DEVELOPMENT\npackage \&quot;BOUNDARY 1 — DEVELOPER LOCAL WORKSPACE\\nCURRENT / VERIFIED — REPOSITORY\&quot; as LOCAL {\n\n  node \&quot;Developer Workstation\\nWindows + Docker Desktop\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N8 &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; {\n\n    artifact \&quot;Mã nguồn local\\nfrontend/ · backend/\&quot; as SRC_LOCAL\n    artifact \&quot;backend/.env\\nChỉ tên biến; ẩn giá trị secret\&quot; as ENV_LOCAL &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n\n    artifact \&quot;docker-compose.dev.yml\&quot; as SPEC_DEV &lt;&lt;deploymentSpec&gt;&gt;\n    artifact \&quot;docker-compose.app.yml\&quot; as SPEC_APP &lt;&lt;deploymentSpec&gt;&gt;\n\n    node \&quot;Docker Engine / Compose\\nProject: docker\\nMạng bridge nội bộ\&quot; as N9 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt; {\n\n      node \&quot;web container\\nNode.js 22 · next start\\nContainer port 3000\\nHost port 3000\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N12 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt; {\n        artifact \&quot;Next.js build output\\n.next/\&quot; as ART_WEB &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n      }\n\n      node \&quot;api container\\nNode.js 22 · node dist/main.js\\nContainer port 3001\\nHost binding 127.0.0.1:3001\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N11 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt; {\n        artifact \&quot;NestJS build output\\ndist/main.js\&quot; as ART_API &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n      }\n\n      node \&quot;db container\\nPostgreSQL 16-alpine\\nContainer port 5432\\nHost port 5433 — publish mọi interface\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N10 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt; {\n        database \&quot;BrewLite DB\\nLocal PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB_LOCAL\n        artifact \&quot;docker_brewlite_pgdata\\nMount: /var/lib/postgresql/data\\nDocker local driver\&quot; as N13 &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n&#39; BOUNDARY 2 — CI/CD\npackage \&quot;BOUNDARY 2 — CI/CD &amp; CONTAINER REGISTRY\&quot; as CICD {\n\n  node \&quot;GitHub Repository\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N14 {\n    artifact \&quot;PhucTruong11/brewlite\\nHEAD: 42553db8\&quot; as REPO_MAIN &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    artifact \&quot;PhucTruong11/brewlite-assignment2\\nSnapshot: 3e7744a7\&quot; as REPO_A2 &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    artifact \&quot;workflows/ci.yml\\nACTIVE — PR vào main\&quot; as CI_FILE &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    artifact \&quot;workflows/cd.yml.example\\nTEMPLATE — chưa kích hoạt\&quot; as CD_FILE &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n  }\n\n  node \&quot;GitHub Actions Runner\\nubuntu-latest · Node.js 22\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N15 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt;\n\n  node \&quot;GitHub Container Registry (GHCR)\\n[PLANNED / TEMPLATE]\\nChưa xác minh image đã push\&quot; as N16\n}\n\n&#39; BOUNDARY 3 — PRODUCTION CLOUD\npackage \&quot;BOUNDARY 3 — PRODUCTION CLOUD\\nVERIFIED LIVE TOPOLOGY (với giới hạn bằng chứng được ghi rõ)\&quot; as PROD {\n\n  node \&quot;Vercel Platform\\nEdge / CDN / Runtime\\nHTTPS public: 443\\n[VERIFIED — LIVE]\&quot; as N2 {\n    node \&quot;Next.js Frontend\\nNext.js 16.4.2 · React 19.2.8\\nSSR + static assets\\n[VERIFIED — REPO + LIVE]\&quot; as N3 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt; {\n      artifact \&quot;Next.js application\\nSSR pages + static assets\&quot; as ART_FRONT &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n      artifact \&quot;frontend/next.config.ts\\nrewrite /api/* → API destination\&quot; as ART_REWRITE &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    }\n  }\n\n  node \&quot;Cloudflare\\nProxy phía trước Render\\nHeader Cf-Ray quan sát được\\n[VERIFIED LIVE — vai trò chi tiết chưa xác minh]\&quot; as N4\n\n  node \&quot;Render Service\\nPublic HTTPS: 443\\nRuntime Node.js 22 [INFERRED]\\n[VERIFIED — LIVE]\&quot; as N5 {\n    node \&quot;NestJS API Runtime\\nNestJS + Prisma Client\\nInternal port 3001 [INFERRED]\\nREST prefix /api + cron scheduler\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N6 &lt;&lt;executionEnvironment&gt;&gt; {\n      artifact \&quot;Backend build output\\ndist/main.js\&quot; as ART_NEST &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    }\n  }\n\n  node \&quot;Supabase\\nManaged PostgreSQL\\nPersistent storage do Supabase quản lý\\n[OWNER-PROVIDED — NOT VERIFIED độc lập]\&quot; as N7\n}\n\n&#39; EXTERNAL SERVICES — nằm ngoài ba boundary\nnode \&quot;SePay\\nQR image + payment webhook\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N17\nnode \&quot;PayOS\\nPayment webhook\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N18\nnode \&quot;SMTP Server\\nGmail theo cấu hình mặc định\\n[VERIFIED — REPO]\&quot; as N19\n\n&#39; COMMUNICATION PATHS — Association nét liền\n&#39; Production\nN1 -- N2 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nTruy cập website\nN3 -- N4 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nNext.js rewrite /api/* → API\nN4 -- N5 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nProxy tới Render public endpoint\nN6 -- N7 : PostgreSQL / TCP 5432 hoặc 6543\\n[OWNER-PROVIDED; port + TLS UNKNOWN]\n\n&#39; Payment and email\nN1 -- N17 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nTải ảnh QR từ qr.sepay.vn\nN17 -- N5 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nWebhook: /api/checkout/sepay-webhook\\nRender public endpoint\nN18 -- N5 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nWebhook: /api/checkout/payos-webhook\\nRender public endpoint\nN5 -- N6 : HTTP / TCP 3001\\nRender service → NestJS runtime [INFERRED]\nN6 -- N19 : SMTP(S) / TCP 465 hoặc 587\\nGửi email OTP\n\n&#39; Local Docker\nN12 -- N11 : HTTP / TCP 3001\\nDocker DNS: api:3001\nN11 -- N10 : PostgreSQL / TCP 5432\\nDocker network nội bộ\nN8 -- N12 : HTTP / TCP 3000\\nHost → web container\nN8 -- N10 : TCP 5433\\nHost DB access; publish mọi interface\nN8 -- N11 : HTTP / TCP 3001\\nHost loopback 127.0.0.1:3001\n\n&#39; CI active\nN14 -- N15 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nTrigger PR vào main\n\n&#39; DEPENDENCIES / CONDITIONAL OR PLANNED — nét đứt\n&#39; Không gọi các đường này là Communication Path đã VERIFIED.\nN15 ..&gt; N16 : HTTPS / TCP 443\\nPush Docker image — PLANNED / TEMPLATE\nN14 ..&gt; N2 : Git integration deployment\\n[INFERRED — repo Assignment 2]\nN14 ..&gt; N5 : Git integration deployment\\n[INFERRED — repo Assignment 2]\nN1 ..&gt; N5 : Direct cross-origin API call\\n[INFERRED — chỉ khi env là URL tuyệt đối]\n\n&#39; NOTES — giới hạn bằng chứng và vận hành\nnote bottom of N3\n  Rewrite destination được chọn theo:\n  API_INTERNAL_URL ?? NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\n  ?? fallback http://localhost:3001\n  Giá trị env thực tế trên Vercel: NOT VERIFIED.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N5\n  Render response có header Rndr-Id.\n  Runtime type / region / plan / NODE_ENV / env vars:\n  NOT VERIFIED. Node.js 22 là INFERRED.\n  Port 3001 nội bộ là INFERRED; public HTTPS 443.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N6\n  Không có endpoint /health chuyên dụng trong source.\n  Health check production: UNKNOWN / NOT VERIFIED.\n  Production logging qua Render: cơ chế chi tiết chưa xác minh.\n  CORS production cho phép origin Vercel đã quan sát.\n  JWT cookie access_token: HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax;\n  Secure khi NODE_ENV=production.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N15\n  CI active: trigger khi mở Pull Request vào main.\n  2 job backend/frontend trên ubuntu-latest, Node.js 22.\n  npm ci; backend prisma generate; lint, build, test.\n  Không build Docker image và không deploy.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N7\n  Supabase PostgreSQL được chủ dự án xác nhận qua README.\n  Direct DB port 5432 hay pooler 6543: UNKNOWN.\n  TLS, region, PostgreSQL version, backup/retention: UNKNOWN.\n  Không mô hình hóa thành container hoặc Docker volume.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N10\n  Health check local: pg_isready -U brewlite.\n  Logging: json-file, max-size 10m, max-file 3.\n  Resource limit mỗi container: 512 MB RAM / 0.5 CPU.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N11\n  Health check local: GET /api/products.\n  Không có endpoint /health chuyên dụng.\n  Logging: json-file, max-size 10m, max-file 3.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of N12\n  Health check local: GET /.\n  Logging: json-file, max-size 10m, max-file 3.\nend note\n\nlegend bottom\n  |= Ký hiệu |= Ý nghĩa |\n  | Association nét liền | Communication Path giữa các Node; trạng thái bằng chứng ghi trong nhãn |\n  | Dependency nét đứt | Quan hệ tích hợp / dự kiến / suy luận; không phải Communication Path đã xác minh |\n  | [VERIFIED — REPO] | Có bằng chứng từ repository tại HEAD nêu trong tiêu đề |\n  | [VERIFIED — LIVE] | Quan sát được trên deployment đang chạy ngày 13-11-2026 |\n  | [OWNER-PROVIDED] | Chủ dự án cung cấp; chưa xác minh độc lập |\n  | [INFERRED] | Suy luận có cơ sở; không coi là cấu hình đã xác minh |\n  | [PLANNED / TEMPLATE] | Có trong template/kế hoạch nhưng chưa kích hoạt |\n  | [UNKNOWN / NOT VERIFIED] | Không tự điền hoặc suy diễn |\nendlegend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="iOOD7KRn9CtJKhw9IrwI-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
